%%body
{
  With limited choices and Knight, being the only thing of interest, you roll up your sleeves and fight the mechanical monstrosity.

  It's a difficult battle, in part to its range, its speed wasn't much possibly due to the age of its components, but getting hit was no joke.

  Destroying the mechanical guard, your body felt lighter and Nori spoke up.

    @ Nori "The radio tower's messages have ceased."

  That was a good.

    @ Nori "But... why was that thing just... standing here."

  You're curious why Nori was calling it a thing, was it not a machine, a robot, kinda like PAWN was?

    @ Nori "No, PAWN was purely machine, Knight was something else, it spoke like a machine, but it was all a front..."

  You had no idea what Nori was getting to, but you'd likely learn more eventually.

    @ Nori "Believe me, I'd tell you more, if I understood it myself."

  With Knight out of the picture, you were curious if Steel was possible now.

    @ Nori "I did note a shift in the world, so it's highly possible we can continue our operations now."

  Nodding, you'd return to your original work for now.
}
%date 2026-08-12
